===Etymology===
From {{inh|fr|fro|combien}}, from {{m|fro|comme}} + {{m|fro|bien}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{fr-IPA}}
* {{audio|fr|Fr-combien.ogg|audio (France)}}

===Adverb===
{{fr-adv}}

# [[how much]] (for uncountable nouns)
# [[how much]] (for money)
#: {{uxi|fr|Je ne sais pas '''combien''' d'argent est-ce que j'ai.|I don't know how much money I have.}}
# [[how many]] (for countable nouns)
#: {{uxi|fr|'''Combien''' de chansons va-t-elle chanter ?|How many songs is she going to sing?}}

